{
 "id": "seg3a",
 "title": "断在哪一关",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 142.3,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3a-00",
   "text": "2024 年以来的六起大额事件，我们一个一个，放到这条路上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.245
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-01",
   "text": "先看第二关。2026 年 9 月，Bitget 被转走约 3.9 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.316,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 7.414,
   "speechEnd": 12.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-02",
   "text": "项目方说，一款第三方安全产品的零日漏洞，泄露了内部凭证。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.872,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 13.97,
   "speechEnd": 19.136
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-03",
   "text": "攻击者用定制工具，伪造了提现指令。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-03.mp3",
   "start": 20.188,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 20.286,
   "speechEnd": 23.357
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-04",
   "text": "项目方说，私钥和冷钱包没有受影响。那款产品的名字，至今没有公开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.416,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 24.514,
   "speechEnd": 30.476
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-05",
   "text": "再看第四关。2024 年 7 月，WazirX 损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-05.mp3",
   "start": 31.548,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 31.646,
   "speechEnd": 37.036
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-06",
   "text": "WazirX 说，托管方 Liminal 界面上显示的，和实际签的不一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.104,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 38.202,
   "speechEnd": 42.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-07",
   "text": "Liminal 说，自己没有被攻破。双方说法冲突，还没有最终的独立报告。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-07.mp3",
   "start": 43.628,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 43.726,
   "speechEnd": 49.449
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-08",
   "text": "同样断在第四关的，是开头讲的 Bybit。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-08.mp3",
   "start": 50.52,
   "dur": 4.128,
   "speechStart": 50.618,
   "speechEnd": 53.808
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-09",
   "text": "Safe 说，一名开发者的电脑先被攻破，攻击者劫持了他的 AWS 会话令牌，",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-09.mp3",
   "start": 54.868,
   "dur": 7.512,
   "speechStart": 54.966,
   "speechEnd": 61.537
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-10",
   "text": "改掉了托管在 S3 上的前端代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-10.mp3",
   "start": 62.6,
   "dur": 3.48,
   "speechStart": 62.698,
   "speechEnd": 65.233
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-11",
   "text": "篡改的代码，只对 Bybit 的冷钱包生效。交易完成大约 2 分钟后，代码又被换了回来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-11.mp3",
   "start": 66.3,
   "dur": 7.344,
   "speechStart": 66.398,
   "speechEnd": 72.8
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-12",
   "text": "签名人看到的屏幕，来自同一个被篡改的前端。他们没有第二个地方可以核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-12.mp3",
   "start": 73.864,
   "dur": 6.624,
   "speechStart": 73.962,
   "speechEnd": 79.638
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-13",
   "text": "第五关，签名人自己。2026 年 4 月，Solana 上的 Drift，损失约 2.85 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-13.mp3",
   "start": 80.708,
   "dur": 8.184,
   "speechStart": 80.806,
   "speechEnd": 88.041
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-14",
   "text": "第三方分析说，安全委员会五个人里两人签名就能生效，迁移后没有时间锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-14.mp3",
   "start": 89.112,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 89.21,
   "speechEnd": 95.162
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-15",
   "text": "成员预先签了，自己没完全看懂的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-15.mp3",
   "start": 96.196,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 96.294,
   "speechEnd": 99.186
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-16",
   "text": "Solana 的持久 nonce，让这些签名不会自然过期。攻击者可以等，等到时机合适再提交。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-16.mp3",
   "start": 100.256,
   "dur": 7.824,
   "speechStart": 100.354,
   "speechEnd": 107.244
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-17",
   "text": "再看那条支线，数据源。同在 2026 年 4 月，KelpDAO 损失约 2.92 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-17.mp3",
   "start": 108.3,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 108.398,
   "speechEnd": 115.145
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-18",
   "text": "这座跨链桥只用了一个验证者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-18.mp3",
   "start": 116.2,
   "dur": 3.144,
   "speechStart": 116.298,
   "speechEnd": 118.512
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-19",
   "text": "LayerZero 说，攻击者替换了它依赖的两个 RPC 节点，再用 DDoS 打掉其他节点，逼它切换过去。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-19.mp3",
   "start": 119.564,
   "dur": 8.472,
   "speechStart": 119.662,
   "speechEnd": 127.185
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-20",
   "text": "恶意节点只对这个验证者撒谎。验证者本身没被攻破，它诚实地，对假数据签了名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-20.mp3",
   "start": 128.256,
   "dur": 8.232,
   "speechStart": 128.354,
   "speechEnd": 135.659,
   "spoken": "恶意节点只对这个验证者撒谎。验证者本身没被攻破，它诚实的，对假数据签了名。"
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3a-21",
   "text": "责任怎么划分，双方有争议，已经进入诉讼。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3a-21.mp3",
   "start": 136.708,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 136.806,
   "speechEnd": 140.258
  }
 ],
